{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Vegetable is the category used for many of the ",["l","农作物","Crops"]," grown on the farm. One ",["l","采集","foraged"]," item, ",["l","蕨菜","Fiddlehead Fern"],", is also considered to be a vegetable. Other foraged items that are real-life vegetables (e.g., ",["l","韭葱","Leek"],"s, ",["l","大葱","Spring Onion"],"s) are categorized as ",["l","采集","Forage"]," instead of Vegetable and therefore are not included here."]],["p",["All vegetables share several in-game characteristics."]],["l",0,[[1,["Their sell prices are increased by 10% if the player has the ",["l","技能","Tiller"]," profession."]],[1,["They can be placed in a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]," to make ",["l","果酱和腌菜","Pickles"],"."]],[1,["They can be placed in a ",["l","小桶","Keg"],". In most cases, the product is ",["l","果汁","Juice"],", except: ",["l","小麦","Wheat"]," produces ",["l","啤酒","Beer"],", ",["l","啤酒花","Hops"]," produce ",["l","淡啤酒","Pale Ale"]," and ",["l","茶叶","Tea Leaves"]," produce ",["l","绿茶","Green Tea"],"."]],[1,["Vegetables (other than ",["l","啤酒花","Hops"],", ",["l","茶叶","Tea Leaves"],", ",["l","未碾米","Unmilled Rice"],", and ",["l","小麦","Wheat"],") are a ",["l","友谊","universally liked gift"],"; all villagers other than ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", and ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," like them. There are various individual exceptions, however, as detailed at ",["l","友谊","Universal Likes exceptions"],", and on the individual vegetable and villager pages."]],[1,["Vegetables are one category used when scoring items in the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Grange Display"]," at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],"."]],[1,["They can be sold at the ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","General Store"]," (as well as in the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"],")."]],[1,["All shipped vegetables are added to the ",["l","收集品","Items Shipped"]," page of the Collections tab."]]]],["p",["The following tables lists all vegetables, where to obtain them, how much they sell 